## ✅ Your UiPath Maestro Flow is ready!

**File:** `SlackChannelDescription/SlackChannelDescription/SlackChannelDescription.flow`

### What was built

A clean 3-node flow:

```
[Manual Trigger] → [Get Channel Info (Slack)] → [End]
```

| Node | What it does |
|---|---|
| **Manual trigger** | You kick it off on demand — no schedule |
| **Get Channel Info** | Uses the real **UiPath Slack connector** (IS connection `is-sandboxes`) to call Slack's API and retrieve the channel's full info |
| **End** | Returns the results |

### Inputs & Outputs

| Name | Direction | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `channelId` | **Input** | The Slack channel ID you want to look up (e.g. `C1234567890`) |
| `channelDescription` | **Output** | The channel's **purpose/description** text |
| `channelTopic` | **Output** | The channel's **topic** text |

> **Tip:** To find a channel ID in Slack — right-click the channel → *View channel details* → scroll down to "About" → *Copy channel ID*.

